imperative mood.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":14,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Capitalize the first letter and do not end the subject with a period.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":15,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Aim for no more than 50 characters. Never exceed the 72-character hard limit.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":16,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Add an optional `\u003cscope\u003e:` or `\u003ccategory\u003e:` prefix only when it improves clarity.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":17,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":18,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"## Commit bodies","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":19,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Add a body for every non-trivial commit, separated from the subject by a blank line.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":21,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Wrap body lines at 72 characters and use blank lines between paragraphs. Use bullet points when they improve clarity.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Explain what the change does and why it is needed; leave implementation mechanics to the diff.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Describe the existing situation in the present tense and the action being taken in the imperative mood.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"## Commit structure","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Keep commits logical and atomic: each commit should represent one coherent change and remain reviewable on its own.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Split a change when its commit description becomes too long or combines independent concerns.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Review the exact staged diff before committing so unrelated files or changes are not included.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":31,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"## Branch names","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":32,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":33,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- Use a meaningful kebab-case name made from relevant keywords, such as `refactor-ui-tests`.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":34,"author":{"gitId":"lukelouyu"},"content":"- For issue-related branches, use `issueNumber-keywords-from-issue-title`, such as `1234-ui-freeze-error`.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T00:11:09","isFullCredit":false}],"authorContributionMap":{"lukelouyu":34}},{"path":".agents/skills/seedu-java-coding-standard/SKILL.